## Backend Changes (7 files, 242 insertions)

### Database Schema (Auto-Migration)

| Table | Column/Object | Purpose |
|-------|--------------|---------|
| `users` | `active_device_id TEXT` | Currently authorized device |
| `users` | `session_version INT` | Increments on new-device login, invalidates old JWTs |
| `users` | `last_login_at TIMESTAMP` | Audit trail |
| `refresh_tokens` | New table (id, user_id, token_hash, created_at) | Stores SHA-256 hashed refresh tokens |
| `otp_requests` | `attempts INT` | Failed verification counter |
| `otp_requests` | `blocked_until TIMESTAMP` | Auto-block after 5 failed attempts |

