### OTP Abuse Controls

| Protection | Rule |
|------------|------|
| Cooldown | 60 seconds between OTP requests |
| Rate limit | Max 3 OTP requests per 10 minutes |
| Brute force | Max 5 wrong PIN attempts → 30-min block |

### Audit Logging

Events logged: `NEW_DEVICE_LOGIN`, `SESSION_REVOKED`, `OTP_RATE_LIMITED`, `OTP_VERIFY_FAILED_LIMIT`

